e\\tArea 1\\tDilution Factor\\tOTC Ct (mg L-1)\\t% Removal 1\\tQt1 (mg g-1)\\tCt/C0\\tArea 2\\tDilution Factor\\tOTC Ct (mg L-1)\\t% Removal 2\\tQt2 (mg g-1)\\tCt/C0\\tArea 3\\tDilution Factor\\tOTC Ct (mg L-1)\\t% Removal 3\\tQt3 (mg g-1)\\tCt/C0\\tMean Qt\\tS. Deviation\\n0\\t759644\\t4\\t80.81866796\\t0.00%\\t0\\t1\\t759644\\t4\\t80.81866796\\t0.00%\\t0\\t1\\t759644\\t4\\t80.81866796\\t0.00%\\t0\\t1\\t0\\t0\\n1\\t589887\\t4\\t62.47944688\\t22.69%\\t33.34403834\\t0.773081869\\t587653\\t4\\t62.23810295\\t22.99%\\t33.78284547\\t0.770095629\\t566102\\t4\\t59.90990115\\t25.87%\\t38.01593966\\t0.741287906\\t35.04760782\\t2.579996771\\n5\\t655175\\t3\\t52.14948955\\t35.47%\\t52.12577894\\t0.645265393\\t636513\\t3\\t50.63741695\\t37.34%\\t54.87500184\\t0.626555946\\t628751\\t3\\t50.00850754\\t38.12%\\t56.01847351\\t0.618774211\\t54.33975143\\t2.000784222\\n10\\t882019\\t2\\t47.01955383\\t41.82%\\t61.45293479\\t0.581790755\\t855654\\t2\\t45.59541943\\t43.58%\\t64.04227005\\t0.5641694\\t828871\\t2\\t44.14870631\\t45.37%\\t66.67265754\\t0.546268671\\t64.05595413\\t2.609888281\\n20\\t812799\\t2\\t43.28055961\\t46.45%\\t68.2511061\\t0.535526763\\t858140\\t2\\t45.72970345\\t43.42%\\t63.79811729\\t0.565830947\\t809592\\t2\\t43.10732998\\t46.66%\\t68.56606905\\t0.533383327\\t66.87176415\\t2.666510671\\n30\\t669951\\t2\\t35.56446821\\t55.99%\\t82.28036318\\t0.44005264\\t731827\\t2\\t38.90676822\\t51.86%\\t76.20345408\\t0.481408184\\t738868\\t2\\t39.28709555\\t51.39%\\t75.51194983\\t0.486114119\\t77.99858903\\t3.724209572\\n45\\t678530\\t2\\t36.02787231\\t55.42%\\t81.43781029\\t0.445786515\\t734790\\t2\\t39.06681791\\t51.66%\\t75.91245464\\t0.48338854\\t677329\\t2\\t35.96299897\\t55.50%\\t81.5557618\\t0.444983812\\t79.63534224\\t3.224654588\\n60\\t653977\\t2\\t34.70161508\\t57.06%\\t83.84918706\\t0.429376231\\t697797\\t2\\t37.06860044\\t54.13%\\t79.54557731\\t0.458663838\\t671975\\t2\\t35.67379679\\t55.86%\\t82.08158395\\t0.441405404\\t81.82544944\\t2.163207776\\n\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_65b03b26dbfbc515460ab8e77869de6cb86d27ca1115f1f9cc1db38aaec11370\",\"user_id\":\"u_d0386557036239e0f13765c103ca48ae005fec6345f5174bda6c7f0b06aa5a66\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:02:55.501+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 2445.36, "body_chars": 700, "request_id": "r_caa53e4a73404df175905af82ee73416ea25486a5d1a11dc9138936f0bdbe6ed", "user_id": "u_c1b63642d0669a9b5b52e145acc4855ca7e5f31329301c4c954d72b396e781f3", "session_id": "s_4b2594716313d22efe86215030581ecc53fdbcfc2e4fadc91988b17275b10234", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_caa53e4a73404df175905af82ee73416ea25486a5d1a11dc9138936f0bdbe6ed\",\"user_id\":\"u_c1b63642d0669a9b5b52e145acc4855ca7e5f31329301c4c954d72b396e781f3\",\"session_id\":\"s_4b2594716313d22efe86215030581ecc53fdbcfc2e4fadc91988b17275b10234\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Cool, gonna give it a try. Thanks for the suggestion!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: No problem! Let me know how you like it. Have fun hiking!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Thanks! I'll let you know. Have a good one!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Take care and have a good one! See ya!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:02:58.023+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 8006.6, "body_chars": 7012, "request_id": "r_2ecc46afdba0506bb32e675bdb77b10730fad204db8cb85310dbd9961e5648a6", "user_id": "u_d93c8f73e1c9469984f3910e7d36944298387c910816fdfbeebe45eb523753c9", "session_id": "s_d1762eab0a8cb7a4d6c2edaa02bb0878dd39e82f174abdc9360b2746f022af4b", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_2ecc46afdba0506bb32e675bdb77b10730fad204db8cb85310dbd9961e5648a6\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704326400000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:1][text] Caroline: Hey Melanie! How's it going? I wanted to tell you about my school event last week. It was awesome! I talked about my transgender journey and encouraged students to get involved in the LGBTQ community. It was great to see their reactions. It made me reflect on how far I've come since I started transitioning three years ago.\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704326460000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:2][text] Melanie: Hey Caroline! Great to hear from you. Sounds like your event was amazing! I'm so proud of you for spreading awareness and getting others involved in the LGBTQ community. You've come a long way since your transition - keep on inspiring people with your strength and courage!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704326520000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:3][text] Caroline: Thanks, Mel! Your backing really means a lot. I felt super powerful giving my talk. I shared my own journey, the struggles I had and how much I've developed since coming out. It was wonderful to see how the audience related to what I said and how it inspired them to be better allies. Conversations about gender identity and inclusion are so necessary and I'm thankful for being able to give a voice to the trans community.\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704326580000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:4][text] Melanie: Wow, Caroline, you're doing an awesome job of inspiring others with your journey. It's great to be part of it and see how you're positively affecting so many. Talking about inclusivity and acceptance is crucial, and you're so brave to speak up for the trans community. Keep up the great work!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704326640000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:5][text] Caroline: Thanks Mel! Your kind words mean a lot. Sharing our experiences isn't always easy, but I feel it's important to help promote understanding and acceptance. I've been blessed with loads of love and support throughout this journey, and I want to pass it on to others. By sharing our stories, we can build a strong, supportive community of hope.\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704326700000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:6][text] Melanie: Yeah, Caroline! It takes courage to talk about our own stories. But it's in these vulnerable moments that we bond and understand each other. We all have our different paths, but if we share them, we show people that they're not alone. Our stories can be so inspiring and encouraging to others who are facing the same challenges. Thank you for using your voice to create love, acceptance, and hope. You're doing amazing!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704326760000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:7][text] Caroline: Your words mean a lot to me. I'm grateful for the chance to share my story and give others hope. We all have unique paths, and by working together we can build a more inclusive and understanding world. I'm going to keep using my voice to make a change and lift others up. And you're part of that!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704326820000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:8][text] Melanie: Thanks, Caroline, for letting me join your journey. I'm so proud to be part of the difference you're making. Let's keep motivating and helping each other out as we journey through life. We can make a real impact together!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704326880000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:9][text] Caroline: Yeah Mel, let's spread love and understanding! Thanks for the support and encouragement. We can tackle life's challenges together! We got this!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704326940000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:10][text] Melanie: Yes, Caroline! We can do it. Your courage is inspiring. I want to be couragous for my family- they motivate me and give me love. What motivates you?\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327000000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:11][text] Caroline: Thanks, Mel! My friends, family and mentors are my rocks – they motivate me and give me the strength to push on. Here's a pic from when we met up last week!\\na photo of a family posing for a picture in a yard\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704327060000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:12][text] Melanie: Wow, that photo is great! How long have you had such a great support system?\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327120000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:13][text] Caroline: Yeah, I'm really lucky to have them. They've been there through everything, I've known these friends for 4 years, since I moved from my home country. Their love and help have been so important especially after that tough breakup. I'm super thankful. Who supports you, Mel?\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704327180000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:14][text] Melanie: I'm lucky to have my husband and kids; they keep me motivated.\\na photo of a man and a little girl standing in front of a waterfall\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327240000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:15][text] Caroline: Wow, what an amazing family pic! How long have you been married?\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704327300000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:16][text] Melanie: 5 years already! Time flies- feels like just yesterday I put this dress on! Thanks, Caroline!\\na photo of a bride in a wedding dress holding a bouquet\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327360000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:17][text] Caroline: Congrats, Melanie! You both looked so great on your wedding day! Wishing you many happy years together!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704327420000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:18][text] Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! Appreciate your kind words. Looking forward to more happy years. Our family and moments make it all worth it.\\na photo of a man and woman sitting on a blanket eating food\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327480000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:19][text] Caroline: Looks like you had a great day! How was it? You all look so happy!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704327540000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:20][text] Melanie: It so fun! We played games, ate good food, and just hung out together. Family moments make life awesome.\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_d1762eab0a8cb7a4d6c2edaa02bb0878dd39e82f174abdc9360b2746f022af4b\",\"user_id\":\"u_d93c8f73e1c9469984f3910e7d36944298387c910816fdfbeebe45eb523753c9\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:02:58.403+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/get", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 2882.23, "body_chars": 159, "user_id": "u_c1b63642d0669a9b5b52e145acc4855ca7e5f31329301c4c954d72b396e781f3", "query": "Which year did Audrey adopt the first three of her dogs?", "top_k": 100, "body": "{\"query\":\"Which year did Audrey adopt the first three of her dogs?\",\"user_id\":\"u_c1b63642d0669a9b5b52e145acc4855ca7e5f31329301c4c954d72b396e781f3\",\"top_k\":100}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:02:59.037+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 6453.81, "body_chars": 5130, "request_id": "r_cfe30b7d14384ec0d4a28076b3d6b6644a777f53b563c84962477d4a55d2cdc3", "user_id": "u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2", "session_id": "s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_cfe30b7d14384ec0d4a28076b3d6b6644a777f53b563c84962477d4a55d2cdc3\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157200000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:61][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - THE JURY\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157260000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:62][narration] NARRATION: They file through a long corridor, than through one door, then another. They are silent, serious. All we hear is the sound of their footsteps. Credits are superimposed over this scene. As credits end:\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157320000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:63][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - THE JURY ROOM\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157380000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:64][narration] NARRATION: The room is empty, silent save for the sounds of traffic twelve floors below. In center of room is a large scarred table and twelve chairs. There are four other chairs against the opposite the windows. Along one wall are three windows through which wee can see the New York skyline. On the opposite wall is an electric clock and an electric fan. At one end of the Jury room is a coat rack, on either side of which is a door, one lettered \\\"men\\\" and the other lettered \\\"women\\\". Against the fourth wall is an old-fashioned water cooler. There are pencils, pads, ashtrays on the table.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157440000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:65][narration] NARRATION: Nothing else. The room is drab, bare, in need of a painting.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157500000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:66][narration] NARRATION: Camera holds on room then dollies in toward the door as we hear footsteps outside. The doer is opened by a uniformed guard. On the door are lettered the words \\\"Jury Room\\\". The guard stands against the door, holding it open, as the\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157560000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:67][narration] NARRATION: members of the jury file into the room. He holds a dip-board and pencil, and we can see his lips moving, counting the jurymen as they enter. Four or five of the jurymen light cigarettes immediately. They move into the room.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157620000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:68][narration] NARRATION: Juror #2 goes to the water fountain. Juror #9, the old man, enters hastily and goes toward the men's room. Juror #7 enters the room last. The guard steps into the room and closes the door. Again he begins to count the jurors. Camera slowly pans with #7 as he walks across the room toward the windows. The foreman has seated himself at the head of the table. #11 and #4 also sit at the table. #11 begins to make notes in a little pad. #4 reads the newspaper. The others move awkwardly about the room.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157680000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:69][narration] NARRATION: They are all at ease, do not really know each other to talk to, wish they were anywhere but here. There is no conversation for a moment. #7 reaches the window. Camera is on him and #6 who looks out at the skyline. #7 offers a stick of gum to him. He shakes his head. #7 offers the gum to #8 who also locks out window. #8 smiles.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157740000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:70][dialogue] #8: No thanks.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157800000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:71][dialogue] #7: Y'know something'? I phoned up for the weather this morning. This is the hottest day of the year.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157860000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:72][narration] NARRATION: #6 nods and continues to look out window.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157920000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:73][dialogue] #7: You'd think they’d at least air condition the place. I almost dropped dead in court.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157980000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:74][narration] NARRATION: He reaches over and opens the window wider.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158040000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:75][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - CENTERED ON GUARD\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158100000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:76][narration] NARRATION: He has finished counting them.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158160000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:77][dialogue] GUARD: Okay, gentlemen. Everybody's here. If there's anything you went I’m right outside. Just knock.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158220000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:78][narration] NARRATION: He exits, closing the door as camera dollies back to include Juror #5, the youngest Juryman, who watches the door. We hear the lock click. #5 half grins, self-consciously.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158280000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:79][dialogue] #5: I never knew they locked the door.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158340000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:80][dialogue] #10: Sure they lock the door. What'd you think?\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a\",\"user_id\":\"u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:01.646+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 25353.5, "body_chars": 627, "request_id": "r_23b32e3ec89ca361d6fee69352897ce746b4968b6f724cbed2be1278cad167af", "user_id": "u_d9708c111e72f3ceab865cd089fd74fb81d051d2fd74c84ea4bcf9565acf1ad9", "session_id": "s_b6c14a97c1867b9323c19fa01c0941d09699b1778c405c30a859b2caabf17e5b", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_23b32e3ec89ca361d6fee69352897ce746b4968b6f724cbed2be1278cad167af\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704153600000,\"content\":\"[tempreason][session_1][D1:1][text] source: Joaquim Molins is a member of the Centre Union of Catalonia from Jan, 1978 to Jan, 1980. \\n Joaquim Molins is a member of the Democratic Convergence of Catalonia from Jan, 1980 to Jan, 2017. \\n Joaquim Molins is a member of the Catalan Centre from Jan, 1976 to Jan, 1978.\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_b6c14a97c1867b9323c19fa01c0941d09699b1778c405c30a859b2caabf17e5b\",\"user_id\":\"u_d9708c111e72f3ceab865cd089fd74fb81d051d2fd74c84ea4bcf9565acf1ad9\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:01.794+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 1982.3, "body_chars": 4437, "request_id": "r_2d488f8cab8c3b11f63d62c35be47461f92d305e52e9c39c8563fc9ed5883c30", "user_id": "u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2", "session_id": "s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_2d488f8cab8c3b11f63d62c35be47461f92d305e52e9c39c8563fc9ed5883c30\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158400000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:81][dialogue] #5: I don't know. It just never occurred to me.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158460000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:82][narration] NARRATION: #10 gives him the look of a professional know-it-all, and then turns and takes off his jacket. He walks across room to coat rack, camera dollying with him. He passes the Foreman who stands at the head of the table tearing up little slips of paper for ballots, and he stops.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158520000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:83][dialogue] #10: Hey, what's that for?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158580000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:84][dialogue] FOREMAN: Well, I figured we might want to vote by ballots.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158640000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:85][dialogue] #10: Great idea! Maybe we can get him elected senator.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158700000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:86][narration] NARRATION: #10 laughs until he begins to cough. He moves off to the coat\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158760000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:87][narration] NARRATION: The Foreman looks at his watch and compares it with the clock. The 3rd Juror takes a cup of water from the water-cooler, moves to the 2nd Juror and looks around the room as he sips the water.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158820000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:88][dialogue] #3: How'd you like it?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158880000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:89][dialogue] #2: I don't know, it was pretty interesting.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704158940000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:90][dialogue] #3: Yeah? I was falling asleep.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159000000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:91][dialogue] #2: I mean, I've never been on a jury before.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159060000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:92][dialogue] #3: Really? I've sat on juries, and it always amazes me the way these lawyers can talk, and talk and talk, even when the case is as obvious as this one. I mean, did you ever hear so much talk about nothing?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159120000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:93][dialogue] #2: Well, I guess they're entitled.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159180000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:94][dialogue] #3: Sure they are. Everybody deserves a fair trial. That's the system. Listen, I'm the last one to say anything against it, but I'm telling you sometimes I think we'd be better off if we took these tough kids and slapped 'em down before they make trouble, you know? Save us a lot of time and money.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159240000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:95][narration] NARRATION: #2 looks at him nervously, nods, gets up and walks to the water cooler, camera dollying with him. He pours himself a drink and stands alone sipping it. We hear movement in the room during all of this, and quiet ad lib conversation.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159300000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:96][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - THE ROOM FROM #2'S ANGLE\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159360000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:97][narration] NARRATION: #2 big in foreground, sipping his water. #3 is hanging up his jacket. #6 and #8 are looking out windows. #4, #11 and the Foreman are seated at table. #7 and #10 are at far end of the room, talking quietly. #7 lets out a raucous laugh. #9 is still in men's room. #5 walks toward water cooler. #12 is walking over to windows. Camera dollies in on #12. As camera nears #12, #7 calls out to Foreman. #12 stops walking.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159420000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:98][dialogue] #7: Hey, how about getting started here.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159480000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:99][dialogue] #3: Yeah, let's get this over with. We've probably all got things to do.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159540000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:100][dialogue] FOREMAN: Well I was figuring we'd take a five minute break. I mean one gentleman's in the bathroom...\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a\",\"user_id\":\"u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:01.995+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 3199.81, "body_chars": 952, "request_id": "r_a4f01f6ef01aaaf2c57526dd46a0522c468ff9cb63b298445ed43da2f2bfb01a", "user_id": "u_d93c8f73e1c9469984f3910e7d36944298387c910816fdfbeebe45eb523753c9", "session_id": "s_d1762eab0a8cb7a4d6c2edaa02bb0878dd39e82f174abdc9360b2746f022af4b", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_a4f01f6ef01aaaf2c57526dd46a0522c468ff9cb63b298445ed43da2f2bfb01a\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327600000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:21][text] Caroline: Sounds great, Mel! Glad you had a great time. Cherish the moments - they're the best!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704327660000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:22][text] Melanie: Absolutely, Caroline! I cherish time with family. It's when I really feel alive and happy.\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327720000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:23][text] Caroline: I 100% agree, Mel. Hanging with loved ones is amazing and brings so much happiness. Those moments really make me thankful. Family is everything.\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_d1762eab0a8cb7a4d6c2edaa02bb0878dd39e82f174abdc9360b2746f022af4b\",\"user_id\":\"u_d93c8f73e1c9469984f3910e7d36944298387c910816fdfbeebe45eb523753c9\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:02.180+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 1175.14, "body_chars": 611, "request_id": "r_41019e4f7a75d247ce4e15eec22882520eecd5e72c1afc713fb0a0e04f34fe7f", "user_id": "u_c1b63642d0669a9b5b52e145acc4855ca7e5f31329301c4c954d72b396e781f3", "session_id": "s_4c13e1652039bbe6eb50c0807b9fd047db8899024eac02a0af51b5347526c9c1", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_41019e4f7a75d247ce4e15eec22882520eecd5e72c1afc713fb0a0e04f34fe7f\",\"user_id\":\"u_c1b63642d0669a9b5b52e145acc4855ca7e5f31329301c4c954d72b396e781f3\",\"session_id\":\"s_4c13e1652039bbe6eb50c0807b9fd047db8899024eac02a0af51b5347526c9c1\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Streaming online QA feedback:\\n{\\\"method\\\": \\\"locomo_llm_judge\\\", \\\"predicted_answer\\\": \\\"Audrey adopted her dogs three years ago, in 2020.\\\", \\\"qa_id\\\": \\\"locomo5:q0000:step01\\\", \\\"question\\\": \\\"Which year did Audrey adopt the first three of her dogs?\\\", \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"streaming-online-feedback-v1\\\", \\\"score\\\": 1.0}\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:02.824+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 26529.48, "body_chars": 809, "request_id": "r_1f5eaadd9d1ddc4993660042d685d8fadb39b6e6fb2cb394e88325c7f7470914", "user_id": "u_8f0ec2c9d2535a4b36b03b6cd154b2eb6323108d6bbbcd37fa073648e26b2207", "session_id": "s_b837c3f1fddc836b62e16395a9975ccf2aebd7e020bc2bdbfa170aaf768ca588", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_1f5eaadd9d1ddc4993660042d685d8fadb39b6e6fb2cb394e88325c7f7470914\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704153600000,\"content\":\"[mquake_remastered][session_1][D1:1][text] Corpus: {\\\"subject\\\": \\\"Frank Herbert\\\", \\\"relation\\\": \\\"genre\\\", \\\"object\\\": \\\"science fiction\\\", \\\"subject_id\\\": \\\"Q7934\\\", \\\"relation_id\\\": \\\"P136\\\", \\\"object_id\\\": \\\"Q24925\\\"}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704153660000,\"content\":\"[mquake_remastered][session_1][D1:2][text] Corpus: {\\\"subject\\\": \\\"Dune Messiah\\\", \\\"relation\\\": \\\"author\\\", \\\"object\\\": \\\"Frank Herbert\\\", \\\"subject_id\\\": \\\"Q437383\\\", \\\"relation_id\\\": \\\"P50\\\", \\\"object_id\\\": \\\"Q7934\\\"}\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_b837c3f1fddc836b62e16395a9975ccf2aebd7e020bc2bdbfa170aaf768ca588\",\"user_id\":\"u_8f0ec2c9d2535a4b36b03b6cd154b2eb6323108d6bbbcd37fa073648e26b2207\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:03.622+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 1404.03, "body_chars": 4684, "request_id": "r_3ba3ae8e78fbb36d2d7bbc650e4cc17c5f9b70a16b9a0831c3c7e043fecc7336", "user_id": "u_6a76ee024511a3d3657e69ffa2c5dfcdb60ced534cff2a41d9ada4bed2ee5438", "session_id": "s_4b2594716313d22efe86215030581ecc53fdbcfc2e4fadc91988b17275b10234", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_3ba3ae8e78fbb36d2d7bbc650e4cc17c5f9b70a16b9a0831c3c7e043fecc7336\",\"user_id\":\"u_6a76ee024511a3d3657e69ffa2c5dfcdb60ced534cff2a41d9ada4bed2ee5438\",\"session_id\":\"s_4b2594716313d22efe86215030581ecc53fdbcfc2e4fadc91988b17275b10234\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] NOTE: The notes on characters are extremely brief, since it is felt that what they are and who they are will he revealed in their dialogue and actions during the course of the film.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] FOREMAN: 35 years old. Assistant high school football coach.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] A small, petty man who is at first vary of, and then impressed with the authority he has. Handles himself quite formally. Not overly bright, but dogged.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #2: 38 years old. Bank clerk. A meek, hesitant man who finds it difficult to maintain any opinions of his own.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Easily swayed and usually adopts the opinion of the last person to idiom he has spoken.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #3: 40 years old. Head of messenger service. A very strong, very forceful, extremely opinionated man within whom can be detected a streak of sadism. A humorless man who is intolerant of opinions other than his own, and accustomed to forcing his wishes and views upon others.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #4: 50 years old. Stockbroker. A man of wealth and position. A practiced speaker who presents himself well at all times. Seems to feel a little bit above the rest of the Jurors. His only concern is with the facts in this case and he is appalled with the behavior of the others. Constantly preening himself, combing his hair, cleaning his nails, etc.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #5: 25 years old. Mechanic. A naive, very frightened young man who takes his obligations in this case very seriously but who finds it difficult to speak up when his elders have the floor.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #6: 33 years old. Housepainter. An honest, but dull-witted man who comes upon his decisions slowly and carefully.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] A man who finds it difficult to create positive opinions, but who must listen to and digest and accept these opinions offered by others which appeal to him moat.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #7: 42 years old. Salesman. A loud, flashy, glad-handed sales man type who has more important things to do than to sit on a Jury. He is quick to show temper, quick to form opinions on things about which he knows nothing. He is a bully, and, of course, a coward.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #8: 42 years old. Architect. A quiet, thoughtful, gentle man. A man who sees many sides to every question and constantly seeks the truth. A man of strength tempered with compassion. Above all, a man who wants Justice to be done, and will fight to see that it is.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #9: 70 years old. Retired. A mild, gentle old man, long since defeated by life, and now merely waiting to die. A man who recognizes himself for what he is, and mourns the days\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] when it would have been possible to be courageous without shielding himself behind his many years. From the way he take pills whenever he is excited, it is obvious that he has a heart condition.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #10: 46 years old. Garage owner. An angry, bitter man.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] A man who antagonizes almost at sight. A bigot who places no values on any human life save his own. A man who has been no where and is going nowhere and knows it deep within him. He has a bad cold and continually blows his nose, sniffs a ben-zedrine inhaler, etc.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #11: 48 years old. Watchmaker. A refugee from Europe who has come to this country in 1941. A man who speaks with an accent and who is ashamed, humble, almost subservient to the people around him, but a man who will honestly seek Justice because he has suffered through so much injustice.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Juror #12: 30 years old. Advertising man. A slick, bright advertising man who thinks of human beings in terms of percentages, graphs and polls, and has no real understanding of people. A superficial snob, but trying to be a good fellow. Throughout the film he doodles on a scratch pad.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] AND\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] THE JUDGE\"}]}"}
