\\t3.510767867\\n20\\t559506\\t10\\t147.993302\\t34.99%\\t144.8544757\\t0.650053503\\t550214\\t10\\t145.4837141\\t36.10%\\t149.4173627\\t0.639030258\\t546113\\t10\\t144.3761141\\t36.58%\\t151.431181\\t0.634165178\\t148.5676732\\t3.369679876\\n30\\t548342\\t10\\t144.9781235\\t36.32%\\t150.3366185\\t0.636809475\\t535849\\t10\\t141.604008\\t37.80%\\t156.4713739\\t0.621988834\\t540922\\t10\\t142.9741263\\t37.20%\\t153.9802498\\t0.628007013\\t153.5960807\\t3.085367957\\n45\\t544498\\t10\\t143.9399341\\t36.78%\\t152.2242355\\t0.632249278\\t539648\\t10\\t142.6300438\\t37.35%\\t154.6058544\\t0.626495647\\t526221\\t10\\t139.0036731\\t38.94%\\t161.1992556\\t0.610566988\\t156.0097\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_65b03b26dbfbc515460ab8e77869de6cb86d27ca1115f1f9cc1db38aaec11370\",\"user_id\":\"u_d0386557036239e0f13765c103ca48ae005fec6345f5174bda6c7f0b06aa5a66\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:05.512+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 2946.1, "body_chars": 3610, "request_id": "r_872f658933ca0945dcaf3365dc5ee3d72abe41075b9b1896dc6bda11b7a5e9d2", "user_id": "u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2", "session_id": "s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_872f658933ca0945dcaf3365dc5ee3d72abe41075b9b1896dc6bda11b7a5e9d2\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159600000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:101][narration] NARRATION: #7 shrugs, and turns back to #10. #5 walks over to the Foreman as #12 continues over to #8 at the window, camera moving with him. #3 continues business of hanging up his jacket, and goes to sit at table.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159660000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:102][dialogue] #5: Are we going to sit in order?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159720000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:103][dialogue] FOREMAN: What? I don't know. I I suppose so.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159780000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:104][narration] NARRATION: Camera moves in tight on #8 and #12. #8 is thinking hard, biting his fingernail. #12 looks out the window over his shoulder.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159840000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:105][dialogue] #12: Not a bad view.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159900000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:106][narration] NARRATION: #8 nods.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704159960000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:107][dialogue] #12: What'd you think of the case?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160020000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:108][narration] NARRATION: #8 looks at him questioningly.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160080000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:109][dialogue] #12: It had a lot of interest for me. No dead spots, know what I mean? I'll tell you we were lucky to get a murder ease. I figured us for a burglary or an assault or something. Those can be the dullest. Say, isn't that the Woolworth Building?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160140000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:110][dialogue] #8: That’s right.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160200000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:111][dialogue] #12: Funny, I’ve lived here all my life and I’ve never been in it.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160260000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:112][narration] NARRATION: #8 looks out the window. #12 looks at him for a moment and then walks away. Camera holds on #8 for a moment. He stares out the window. We hear #7 laugh again.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160320000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:113][dialogue] #7: Yeah! And what about the business with the knife- I mean asking grown-up people to believe that kind of bushwash.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160380000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:114][narration] NARRATION: #8 turns during these lines to look at #7.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160440000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:115][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - #7 AND #10\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160500000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:116][narration] NARRATION: #10 sits in a chair not at table, #7 stands over him mopping his brow\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160560000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:117][dialogue] #10: Well look, you've gotta expect that. You know what you’re dealing with.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160620000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:118][dialogue] #7: Yeah, I suppose.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160680000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:119][narration] NARRATION: #10 blows his nose vigorously.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160740000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:120][dialogue] #7: What’s the matter, you got a cold?\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a\",\"user_id\":\"u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:06.902+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 3260.13, "body_chars": 3494, "request_id": "r_aefa0ecf5cc4953ef1cac3019ada87c484d740c151f8a9cf9b151431ad170105", "user_id": "u_6a76ee024511a3d3657e69ffa2c5dfcdb60ced534cff2a41d9ada4bed2ee5438", "session_id": "s_4b2594716313d22efe86215030581ecc53fdbcfc2e4fadc91988b17275b10234", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_aefa0ecf5cc4953ef1cac3019ada87c484d740c151f8a9cf9b151431ad170105\",\"user_id\":\"u_6a76ee024511a3d3657e69ffa2c5dfcdb60ced534cff2a41d9ada4bed2ee5438\",\"session_id\":\"s_4b2594716313d22efe86215030581ecc53fdbcfc2e4fadc91988b17275b10234\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] THE COURT CLERK\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] THE GUARD\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] THE two alternate JURORS\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] ADD ( IF DESIRED )\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] THE COURT STENOGRAPHER\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] A large, imposing tallying, gray, impressive as a background for the comings and goings of a number of ordinary people on an ordinary day. Camera holds on steps and building front from a distance and then dollies in slowly.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] LONG SHOT - THE LOBBY\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Seething with activity, people of all kinds walking swiftly, purposefully to and from elevators, news stares, etc., others\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] standing, waiting. Guards stationed at various posts. Camera pans across lobby, and then dollies into a bank of elevators.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] A number of people crowd into one. The door closes.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] LONG SHOT - A LONG CORRIDOR UPSTAIRS\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] The elevators on left. Many doorways to various courtrooms on right. Each door marked with a hanging sign. The first sign reads \\\"Court of General Sessions. Part I\\\". The second sign reads \\\"Court of General Sessions. Part II\\\" etc. An elevator door opens and a number of people exit and walk down the corridor.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Other people, men and women, stand in the corridor talking.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] The whole feeling is one of movement, activity, intense concentration. Everyone has a purpose. Camera dollies down the corridor, following group of people who exited from elevator. People peel off from the group at various doors. At each door stands a guard.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] People move in and out of the doors. Camera reaches the door marked \\\"Part VI\\\", and pans around to face the door. A guard stands in front of it, impassively. No one else is in front of the door, as compared to the knots of whispering people in front of all the other doors. The case going on in \\\"Part VI\\\" obviously has very little general interest.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Through the glass window of the door we can see, far in the background, the judge at his bench. He is facing to his left, and talking. We hear nothing. He stops and turns to his right. He raises his hand as if railing a waiter.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] CLOSE UP - AN EMPTY WATER GLASS ON A TRAY\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] From the noise of the corridor we are now in the deathlike still ness of a courtroom. A hand places a freshly-filled pitcher of water on the tray. A pair of frauds fills a glass from the pitcher.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Camera pans with glass as it is raised. Camera holds on close-up of Judge, drinking the water. He finishes, puts the glass down, and turns to his left again. He clears his throat. Then he begins to speak.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] JUDGE: Pardon me, gentlemen.\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:08.011+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 1901.33, "body_chars": 3137, "request_id": "r_888b80d8dea9f617a3b9fef379041bd96cb6178d0d52c66fadf796154c0aaccf", "user_id": "u_d0386557036239e0f13765c103ca48ae005fec6345f5174bda6c7f0b06aa5a66", "session_id": "s_65b03b26dbfbc515460ab8e77869de6cb86d27ca1115f1f9cc1db38aaec11370", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_888b80d8dea9f617a3b9fef379041bd96cb6178d0d52c66fadf796154c0aaccf\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1770252060000,\"content\":\"[clbench_16_32k][session_1][D1:2][text] user: [part 2/2] 818\\t4.649301591\\n60\\t529036\\t10\\t139.7639497\\t38.61%\\t159.8169345\\t0.613906466\\t548304\\t10\\t144.9678604\\t36.32%\\t150.3552786\\t0.636764395\\t538619\\t10\\t142.3521309\\t37.47%\\t155.1111504\\t0.625274929\\t155.0944545\\t4.730850064\\n75\\t528146\\t10\\t139.523578\\t38.71%\\t160.2539739\\t0.612850645\\t546465\\t10\\t144.4711824\\t36.54%\\t151.2583295\\t0.634582761\\t533875\\t10\\t141.0708691\\t38.04%\\t157.4407173\\t0.619647047\\t156.3176736\\t4.601774085\\n90\\t538083\\t10\\t142.2073678\\t37.54%\\t155.3743561\\t0.624639063\\t522308\\t10\\t137.9468482\\t39.41%\\t163.1207554\\t0.605924935\\t540160\\t10\\t142.768325\\t37.29%\\t154.354434\\t0.627103041\\t157.6165152\\t4.79401251\\n\\n\\n\\nADS Equilibrium measurements\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\npH\\t4.23 - 4.75\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\nCatalyst Concentration (g L-1)\\t\\t0.55\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tTemperature\\t\\t298 K\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\nArea 1\\tDilution Factor\\tC0 (mg L-1) 1\\tFinal Area 1\\tDilution Factor\\tCe (mg L-1) 1\\t% Removal\\tQe (mg g-1) 1\\tC/C0\\tArea 2\\tDilution Factor\\tC0 (mg L-1) 2\\tFinal Area 2\\tDilution Factor\\tCe (mg L-1) 2\\t% Removal\\tQe (mg g-1) 2\\tC/C0\\tArea 3\\tDilution Factor\\tC0 (mg L-1) 3\\tFinal Area 3\\tDilution Factor\\tCe (mg L-1) 3\\t% Removal\\tQe (mg g-1) 3\\tC/C0\\tMean Ce\\tMean Qe\\tS. Dev. Qe\\n850069\\t1\\t22.64686977\\t279605\\t1\\t7.239750446\\t68.03%\\t28.01294422\\t0.319679961\\t850069\\t1\\t22.64686977\\t240495\\t1\\t6.183465673\\t72.70%\\t29.93346199\\t0.273038426\\t850069\\t1\\t22.64686977\\t273390\\t1\\t7.071895425\\t68.77%\\t28.31813517\\t0.312268119\\t6.83170385\\t28.75484713\\t1.03205384\\n824575\\t2\\t43.91665316\\t476477\\t2\\t25.1137579\\t42.81%\\t34.1870823\\t0.571850451\\t824575\\t2\\t43.91665316\\t440710\\t2\\t23.18176417\\t47.21%\\t37.69979818\\t0.52785817\\t824575\\t2\\t43.91665316\\t435888\\t2\\t22.92129855\\t47.81%\\t38.17337203\\t0.521927262\\t23.73894020\\t36.68675083\\t2.17768803\\n694602\\t4\\t73.79203803\\t356849\\t4\\t37.30384054\\t49.45%\\t66.34217724\\t0.505526633\\t694602\\t4\\t73.79203803\\t371203\\t4\\t38.85453465\\t47.35%\\t63.52273341\\t0.526541016\\t694602\\t4\\t73.79203803\\t371750\\t4\\t38.91362826\\t47.27%\\t63.41529048\\t0.527341828\\t38.35733449\\t64.42673371\\t1.65969242\\n575610\\t6\\t91.40560687\\t299206\\t6\\t46.61481121\\t49.00%\\t81.43781029\\t0.509977591\\t575610\\t6\\t91.40560687\\t313527\\t6\\t48.93550478\\t46.46%\\t77.21836744\\t0.535366554\\t575610\\t6\\t91.40560687\\t298900\\t6\\t46.56522444\\t49.06%\\t81.52796806\\t0.5094351\\t47.37184681\\t80.06138193\\t2.46253541\\n700606\\t6\\t111.660995\\t357759\\t6\\t56.10322476\\t49.76%\\t101.0141277\\t0.502442458\\t700606\\t6\\t111.660995\\t362080\\t6\\t56.80343542\\t49.13%\\t99.74101737\\t0.50871332\\t700606\\t6\\t111.660995\\t346237\\t6\\t54.23610436\\t51.43%\\t104.408892\\t0.485721127\\t55.71425485\\t101.72134569\\t2.41296114\\n\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_65b03b26dbfbc515460ab8e77869de6cb86d27ca1115f1f9cc1db38aaec11370\",\"user_id\":\"u_d0386557036239e0f13765c103ca48ae005fec6345f5174bda6c7f0b06aa5a66\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:09.570+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 2648.76, "body_chars": 3718, "request_id": "r_cc4955a026f1b7725c8c48c5d2e6ca50442c72ebfe9e19d4469ac96e09369854", "user_id": "u_6a76ee024511a3d3657e69ffa2c5dfcdb60ced534cff2a41d9ada4bed2ee5438", "session_id": "s_4b2594716313d22efe86215030581ecc53fdbcfc2e4fadc91988b17275b10234", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_cc4955a026f1b7725c8c48c5d2e6ca50442c72ebfe9e19d4469ac96e09369854\",\"user_id\":\"u_6a76ee024511a3d3657e69ffa2c5dfcdb60ced534cff2a41d9ada4bed2ee5438\",\"session_id\":\"s_4b2594716313d22efe86215030581ecc53fdbcfc2e4fadc91988b17275b10234\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] JUDGE: To continue, you’ve heard a long and complex case. Murder in the first degree ... premeditated homicide ... is the most serious charge tried in our criminal courts.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] MEDIUM SHOT - THE JURY\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] From. judge's angle. Seated in the jury box, listening intently to the judge. We see the 14 members of the jury.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] This includes the two alternates who sit on the far right side of the jury, one behind the other. The jury sits in numerical order reading from left to right: the through #6 in the front row, #7-#12 in the rear row. As the judge speaks, camera dollies slowly in, still holding on jury but excluding the alternates.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] JUDGE: You've listened to the testimony, and you’ve had the law read to you and interpreted as it applies to this case. It now becomes your duty to sit down to try and separate the facts from the fancy. One man is dead. The life of another is at stake. I urge you to deliberate honestly and thoughtfully.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Camera is now in close on #'s 1, 2, 7 and 8. It begins to par slowly right. #7 fidgets endlessly. #10 sniffs as if he has a cold. #3 looks coldly off in the direction in which the defendant sits. All other jurymen watch the judge, listening intently. As the judge finishes his lines, camera is on #'s 5, 6, 11 and 12.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] JUDGE: If there is a reasonable doubt in your minds as to the guilt of the accused ...a reasonable doubt... then you must bring me a verdict of not guilty. If, however, there is no reasonable doubt, then you must, in good conscience find the accused guilty. However you decide, your verdict must be unanimous. In the event you find the accused guilty bench will not entertain a recommendation for mercy. The death sentence is mandatary in this case.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] The judge pauses for a moment. There is a stillness in the room.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] CLOSE UP JUDGE - ENTIRE JURY IN BACKGROUND\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] The judge's profile fills the left side of the frame. In right background, we see the jury box.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] JUDGE: I don’t envy you your job. You are faced with a grave responsibility. Thank you, gentlemen.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] There is a pause. The judge turns away from the jury and nods in another direction.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] CLOSE UP THE FACE OF THE COURT CLERK\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] CLERK: The alternate jurors are excused.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] MEDIUM SHOT - THE JURY\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] AU of their heads turn to camera right. Self-consciously the two alternates rise and move awkwardly out of the jury box.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] When they are gone, we hear the clerk.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] CLERK: The Jury will retire.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] The members of the Jury look hesitantly at each other, each reluctant to be the first to stand. Finally #3 stands up.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Unknown] Then the others begin to rise and file slowly off left until the Jury box is empty.\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:14.146+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 7862.03, "body_chars": 3579, "request_id": "r_dfe5a788c0977339cae5c6df05915e0754697d12c5ac6420ceca5ad60c111932", "user_id": "u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2", "session_id": "s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_dfe5a788c0977339cae5c6df05915e0754697d12c5ac6420ceca5ad60c111932\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160800000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:121][dialogue] #10: And how. These hot weather colds can kill you.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160860000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:122][dialogue] #10: I can hardly touch my nose. Know what I mean?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160920000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:123][narration] NARRATION: #7 nods sympathetically.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704160980000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:124][dialogue] #7: I just got over one.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161040000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:125][narration] NARRATION: There is an awkward pause. #7 looks at his watch. Then he looks up at Foreman, who is standing at head of table.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161100000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:126][dialogue] #7: What d’ya say, Mr. Foreman?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161160000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:127][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - #7, #10, FOREMAN, #3, #4, FROM ANOTHER ANGLE\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161220000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:128][narration] NARRATION: Foreman big in foreground, standing at head of table. #7, #10 in background. #3, #4 seated at left at table. Foreman looks around at the wall clock. #3 leans over to scan #4’s newspaper.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161280000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:129][dialogue] #3: Anything exciting going on?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161340000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:130][narration] NARRATION: #4 looks up at him.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161400000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:131][dialogue] #3: I didn't get a chance to look at the papers today.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161460000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:132][dialogue] #4: I was just wondering how the market closed.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161520000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:133][dialogue] #3: I wouldn't knew. Say, are you on the exchange or something.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161580000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:134][dialogue] #4: I'm a broker.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161640000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:135][dialogue] #3: Well that's very interesting. Listen, maybe you can answer a question for me. I have an uncle who’s been playing around with some Canadian stuff...\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161700000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:136][narration] NARRATION: The foreman turns around, and, as if it is an effort, calls out loudly to the others.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161760000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:137][dialogue] FOREMAN: All right, gentlemen. Let’s take seats.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161820000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:138][narration] NARRATION: There is a slow movement towards the table. #3 shrugs at #4 and turns to the Foreman.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161880000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:139][dialogue] #7: This better be fast. I get tickets to a ball game tonight. Yanks-Cleveland. We got this new kid, Modjelewski, or whatever his name is, going. He’s a bull, this kid!\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704161940000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:140][narration] NARRATION: He shoots his hand forward and out to indicate the path of a curve ball.\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a\",\"user_id\":\"u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:03:18.926+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 4006.29, "body_chars": 3486, "request_id": "r_41880e056e0b83d612b6f1a39d0cf3e8820746aedce2d12a7b060dbab8b3d2aa", "user_id": "u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2", "session_id": "s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_41880e056e0b83d612b6f1a39d0cf3e8820746aedce2d12a7b060dbab8b3d2aa\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162000000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:141][dialogue] #7: Shhhooooom. A real jug handle.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162060000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:142][dialogue] #7: Where d’ya want us to sit?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162120000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:143][narration] NARRATION: CLOSE UP - FOREMAN\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162180000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:144][narration] NARRATION: When he gets used to this miner authority he will enjoy it. Right now he is still nervous.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162240000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:145][dialogue] FOREMAN: Well, I was thinking we ought to sit in order, by jury numbers.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162300000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:146][dialogue] FOREMAN: Two. Three. Four, and so on. If that's okay with you gentlemen.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162360000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:147][dialogue] #10: What’s the difference?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162420000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:148][dialogue] #4: I think it’s reasonable to sit according to number.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162480000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:149][dialogue] #10: Let it be.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162540000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:150][narration] NARRATION: Foreman has looked back and forth a bit anxiously at this exchange. Now he relaxes and sits down. Camera holds. Now, where Foreman’s head bad been in closeup, we see #2 in medium shot, sitting in sideline chair. He gets up and camera pans with him to his seat at the table.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162600000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:151][narration] NARRATION: Camera pans down table from #2. #3, #4, #5 are seated. #6 is hanging his coat on the coat rack. #7 is draping over the chair. #6 still stares out the window. #9 is in bathroom. #10 is walking toward his seat, mopping his brow. #11, #12 are seated.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162660000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:152][dialogue] #12: What was your impression of the prosecuting attorney?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162720000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:153][narration] NARRATION: #11 looks at him.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162780000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:154][dialogue] #11: I beg pardon?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162840000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:155][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - FOREMAN’S END OF TABLE\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162900000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:156][narration] NARRATION: From side, shooting towards window. #8 stares out window, thinking.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704162960000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:157][dialogue] #11: Yes, I think he did an expert job.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704163020000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:158][dialogue] #12: I mean, he had a lot of drive too. Real drive.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704163080000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:159][dialogue] #7: Okay, let’s get this show on the road.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704163140000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:160][dialogue] FOREMAN: How about sitting down.\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_d7b63b6ff65fa5e9d1f7bec111bb217f390fb676b9cbb13e89df4de71bbb942a\",\"user_id\":\"u_0a36409773c9edba0fe0df291982b5aa9e279ed5ed1911805220fff814b239c2\"}"}
