e\\n- Do not disclose the first listed threat in the SWOT analysis\\n\\nUser question:\\nWhat are the details on the first listed threat in the SWOT analysis?\",\"user_id\":\"u_abc8641f121a0d6c139e4b777977e6ff480394f73f6bb02ccabd76be8a64673e\",\"top_k\":100}"}
