{"ts": "2026-10-30T08:05:35.648+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 1576.42, "body_chars": 2775, "request_id": "r_bf312c7431a4bb5e511ef3af0b94cf9a2ebbc076e21860aaaecb12e1eba79b95", "user_id": "u_e9c10054ad3daee059efebc6f0dd37e20716e84039ceb1a8f59c8678b3e02d97", "session_id": "s_bf5f468f565e57686500f4bd57829b0a9ac7ca1dccba2e2e004d1f0e2f2f2513", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_bf312c7431a4bb5e511ef3af0b94cf9a2ebbc076e21860aaaecb12e1eba79b95\",\"user_id\":\"u_e9c10054ad3daee059efebc6f0dd37e20716e84039ceb1a8f59c8678b3e02d97\",\"session_id\":\"s_bf5f468f565e57686500f4bd57829b0a9ac7ca1dccba2e2e004d1f0e2f2f2513\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Sep 05, 2025, 13:30:48] Today I'd like to share my current life situation with you, including work, health, and social aspects, so you can have a more comprehensive understanding of my current status.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"[Time: Sep 05, 2025, 13:30:48] Good, please tell me about your current work situation.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Sep 05, 2025, 14:26:47] I am currently Employed, working in the finance industry. I work at Oracle as a manager. My monthly income is 15600 USD, and I currently have 139000 USD in savings. I work as a manager at Oracle in the finance sector. My role involves overseeing financial projects and ensuring our team meets its targets. With a monthly income of $15,600, I have been able to save $139,000, which gives me a sense of financial security. My career has been fulfilling, and I am proud of the progress I've made, but I always strive for further growth and development.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"[Time: Sep 05, 2025, 14:26:47] How is your health condition?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Sep 05, 2025, 15:03:09] My physical condition is Normal. No chronic diseases. In terms of mental health, I am Stable and Normal. No mental health issues. I maintain a balanced lifestyle with regular exercise and a healthy diet, which keeps my physical health in check. Mentally, I stay stable by engaging in activities I like because and surrounding myself with supportive friends and family.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"[Time: Sep 05, 2025, 15:03:09] Can you introduce your social relationships?\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"[Time: Sep 05, 2025, 16:00:48] Of course. I have several important friends and colleagues: WilsonMatthew is my Friend, Matthew is a close friend who always encourages me to pursue my goals and brings a positive outlook to my life. JacksonLinda is my Friend, Linda is someone I can rely on for advice and support, particularly when I face challenges at work. MartinezJohn is my Classmate, John and I studied together, and his analytical skills often inspire me to think critically in my career. WilsonPatricia is my Friend, Patricia is a friend who shares my enthusiasm for supporting Shirley Franco, and we often attend events together.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"[Time: Sep 05, 2025, 16:00:48] Thank you for sharing. I have a clear understanding of your current life situation. I will remember this information and better understand your circumstances and needs in future conversations.\"}]}"}
