e\\tArea 1\\tDilution Factor\\tOTC Ct (mg L-1)\\t% Removal 1\\tQt1 (mg g-1)\\tCt/C0\\tArea 2\\tDilution Factor\\tOTC Ct (mg L-1)\\t% Removal 2\\tQt2 (mg g-1)\\tCt/C0\\tArea 3\\tDilution Factor\\tOTC Ct (mg L-1)\\t% Removal 3\\tQt3 (mg g-1)\\tCt/C0\\tMean Qt\\tS. Deviation\\n0\\t759644\\t4\\t80.81866796\\t0.00%\\t0\\t1\\t759644\\t4\\t80.81866796\\t0.00%\\t0\\t1\\t759644\\t4\\t80.81866796\\t0.00%\\t0\\t1\\t0\\t0\\n1\\t589887\\t4\\t62.47944688\\t22.69%\\t33.34403834\\t0.773081869\\t587653\\t4\\t62.23810295\\t22.99%\\t33.78284547\\t0.770095629\\t566102\\t4\\t59.90990115\\t25.87%\\t38.01593966\\t0.741287906\\t35.04760782\\t2.579996771\\n5\\t655175\\t3\\t52.14948955\\t35.47%\\t52.12577894\\t0.645265393\\t636513\\t3\\t50.63741695\\t37.34%\\t54.87500184\\t0.626555946\\t628751\\t3\\t50.00850754\\t38.12%\\t56.01847351\\t0.618774211\\t54.33975143\\t2.000784222\\n10\\t882019\\t2\\t47.01955383\\t41.82%\\t61.45293479\\t0.581790755\\t855654\\t2\\t45.59541943\\t43.58%\\t64.04227005\\t0.5641694\\t828871\\t2\\t44.14870631\\t45.37%\\t66.67265754\\t0.546268671\\t64.05595413\\t2.609888281\\n20\\t812799\\t2\\t43.28055961\\t46.45%\\t68.2511061\\t0.535526763\\t858140\\t2\\t45.72970345\\t43.42%\\t63.79811729\\t0.565830947\\t809592\\t2\\t43.10732998\\t46.66%\\t68.56606905\\t0.533383327\\t66.87176415\\t2.666510671\\n30\\t669951\\t2\\t35.56446821\\t55.99%\\t82.28036318\\t0.44005264\\t731827\\t2\\t38.90676822\\t51.86%\\t76.20345408\\t0.481408184\\t738868\\t2\\t39.28709555\\t51.39%\\t75.51194983\\t0.486114119\\t77.99858903\\t3.724209572\\n45\\t678530\\t2\\t36.02787231\\t55.42%\\t81.43781029\\t0.445786515\\t734790\\t2\\t39.06681791\\t51.66%\\t75.91245464\\t0.48338854\\t677329\\t2\\t35.96299897\\t55.50%\\t81.5557618\\t0.444983812\\t79.63534224\\t3.224654588\\n60\\t653977\\t2\\t34.70161508\\t57.06%\\t83.84918706\\t0.429376231\\t697797\\t2\\t37.06860044\\t54.13%\\t79.54557731\\t0.458663838\\t671975\\t2\\t35.67379679\\t55.86%\\t82.08158395\\t0.441405404\\t81.82544944\\t2.163207776\\n\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_a8339a97b7d559ee97fd82a1e0892b406232e3bccbc6beec8a3c58c882971ab4\",\"user_id\":\"u_d3988981789f0979871e851297be9445fbd36f2cf623202b134f1d56ece521e8\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T09:44:01.587+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 2493.67, "body_chars": 3266, "request_id": "r_b2d1ea234bcc09a9ca6bc62286b8d3a490855b6752d5ffa45d6bd604a125233c", "user_id": "u_283d6390575576a781abfde28b4c824eb707914dcb8d0b27e1cc50751af8a212", "session_id": "s_cc50e473685fa2bd1cc1070bff66584209187cfa87443dbf41bea9b3b926d94b", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_b2d1ea234bcc09a9ca6bc62286b8d3a490855b6752d5ffa45d6bd604a125233c\",\"user_id\":\"u_283d6390575576a781abfde28b4c824eb707914dcb8d0b27e1cc50751af8a212\",\"session_id\":\"s_cc50e473685fa2bd1cc1070bff66584209187cfa87443dbf41bea9b3b926d94b\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Hey Andrew! Good to see ya! What's been up since we last talked?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Hey Audrey! So, I started a new job as a Financial Analyst last week - it's been quite a change from my previous job. How about you? Anything interesting happening?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Congrats on the new job! So I got these new collars and tags for my dogs - so cute!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Thanks! That sounds cute. Can I see a picture?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Sure! See them with their new collars, cute right?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Cute little guys! What are their names and how long have you had them?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: I've had them for 3 years! Their names are Pepper, Precious and Panda. I can't live without my little ones!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: That's awesome! Have you always wanted a dog, even with living in the city? Can they still go on adventures?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Absolutely! They're city dogs and we explore all the time. They love trying out new parks and trails. We go on adventures together very often.\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Wow, sounds like they make life so awesome! Kinda jealous of all those fun outings with them.\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: They really do! It's great how much happiness they bring. Do you have any pets?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: No, no pets right now. But I do love animals.\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: That's great to hear! Animals are truly amazing. Do you have a favorite animal?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: I've always been awed by birds. Their power to soar and explore new spots is amazing.\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Yeah, birds are amazing! I can imagine it feels incredible to soar and see the world from up high. Do you have a favorite type of bird?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Eagles have always mesmerized me; they're so strong and graceful!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Yeah they're beautiful. Do you go bird-watching? It must be awesome to see them up close.\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Haven't specifically gone out for bird-watching, but I do spot them when I hike.\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Nice, spotting pretty birds while hiking must be great. Do you have any favorite hiking spots?\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Fox Hollow is a great trail to hike on weekends; the views are awesome!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T09:44:02.330+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 724.96, "body_chars": 700, "request_id": "r_818d0b16c98b9ce6762653aaa8c72acf24576c91932e24b18ce1d1496c5bbe2d", "user_id": "u_283d6390575576a781abfde28b4c824eb707914dcb8d0b27e1cc50751af8a212", "session_id": "s_cc50e473685fa2bd1cc1070bff66584209187cfa87443dbf41bea9b3b926d94b", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_818d0b16c98b9ce6762653aaa8c72acf24576c91932e24b18ce1d1496c5bbe2d\",\"user_id\":\"u_283d6390575576a781abfde28b4c824eb707914dcb8d0b27e1cc50751af8a212\",\"session_id\":\"s_cc50e473685fa2bd1cc1070bff66584209187cfa87443dbf41bea9b3b926d94b\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Cool, gonna give it a try. Thanks for the suggestion!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: No problem! Let me know how you like it. Have fun hiking!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Audrey: Thanks! I'll let you know. Have a good one!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Andrew: Take care and have a good one! See ya!\",\"timestamp\":1679922600000}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T09:44:03.078+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 1751.72, "body_chars": 952, "request_id": "r_38ad7dde9add8885f528f3aec33d843fe727f5314c6351b7c1586a6e03e96b4c", "user_id": "u_9bf3f88db5713111b080dfc9dfe16b20267456bd7e5cdbaafd9b1a5627d87bc2", "session_id": "s_9ca881d9437ae9edcecf9f057128e6bd81b420714be0e3e9828c78506809e44a", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_38ad7dde9add8885f528f3aec33d843fe727f5314c6351b7c1586a6e03e96b4c\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327600000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:21][text] Caroline: Sounds great, Mel! Glad you had a great time. Cherish the moments - they're the best!\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"timestamp\":1704327660000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:22][text] Melanie: Absolutely, Caroline! I cherish time with family. It's when I really feel alive and happy.\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704327720000,\"content\":\"[locomo_refined][session_3][D3:23][text] Caroline: I 100% agree, Mel. Hanging with loved ones is amazing and brings so much happiness. Those moments really make me thankful. Family is everything.\\n2023-06-09 19:55\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_9ca881d9437ae9edcecf9f057128e6bd81b420714be0e3e9828c78506809e44a\",\"user_id\":\"u_9bf3f88db5713111b080dfc9dfe16b20267456bd7e5cdbaafd9b1a5627d87bc2\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T09:44:03.313+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/get", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 965.4, "body_chars": 159, "user_id": "u_283d6390575576a781abfde28b4c824eb707914dcb8d0b27e1cc50751af8a212", "query": "Which year did Audrey adopt the first three of her dogs?", "top_k": 100, "body": "{\"query\":\"Which year did Audrey adopt the first three of her dogs?\",\"user_id\":\"u_283d6390575576a781abfde28b4c824eb707914dcb8d0b27e1cc50751af8a212\",\"top_k\":100}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T09:44:05.879+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 5429.65, "body_chars": 4806, "request_id": "r_bd90f5a321a55499679afe8ff1765d5b4087d40300527fa892c6d76a6279f1ab", "user_id": "u_40683a81aadb2e617cbde99e9ad516d4732d1f83d34372efaae3037f692bf2f1", "session_id": "s_553e926e7fa6a6296b5be996eb0a0d76c0490b5d71c0c01e1331de589f556fe6", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_bd90f5a321a55499679afe8ff1765d5b4087d40300527fa892c6d76a6279f1ab\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156000000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:41][dialogue] JUDGE: To continue, you’ve heard a long and complex case. Murder in the first degree ... premeditated homicide ... is the most serious charge tried in our criminal courts.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156060000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:42][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - THE JURY\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156120000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:43][narration] NARRATION: From. judge's angle. Seated in the jury box, listening intently to the judge. We see the 14 members of the jury.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156180000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:44][narration] NARRATION: This includes the two alternates who sit on the far right side of the jury, one behind the other. The jury sits in numerical order reading from left to right: the through #6 in the front row, #7-#12 in the rear row. As the judge speaks, camera dollies slowly in, still holding on jury but excluding the alternates.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156240000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:45][dialogue] JUDGE: You've listened to the testimony, and you’ve had the law read to you and interpreted as it applies to this case. It now becomes your duty to sit down to try and separate the facts from the fancy. One man is dead. The life of another is at stake. I urge you to deliberate honestly and thoughtfully.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156300000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:46][narration] NARRATION: Camera is now in close on #'s 1, 2, 7 and 8. It begins to par slowly right. #7 fidgets endlessly. #10 sniffs as if he has a cold. #3 looks coldly off in the direction in which the defendant sits. All other jurymen watch the judge, listening intently. As the judge finishes his lines, camera is on #'s 5, 6, 11 and 12.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156360000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:47][dialogue] JUDGE: If there is a reasonable doubt in your minds as to the guilt of the accused ...a reasonable doubt... then you must bring me a verdict of not guilty. If, however, there is no reasonable doubt, then you must, in good conscience find the accused guilty. However you decide, your verdict must be unanimous. In the event you find the accused guilty bench will not entertain a recommendation for mercy. The death sentence is mandatary in this case.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156420000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:48][narration] NARRATION: The judge pauses for a moment. There is a stillness in the room.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156480000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:49][narration] NARRATION: CLOSE UP JUDGE - ENTIRE JURY IN BACKGROUND\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156540000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:50][narration] NARRATION: The judge's profile fills the left side of the frame. In right background, we see the jury box.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156600000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:51][dialogue] JUDGE: I don’t envy you your job. You are faced with a grave responsibility. Thank you, gentlemen.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156660000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:52][narration] NARRATION: There is a pause. The judge turns away from the jury and nods in another direction.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156720000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:53][narration] NARRATION: CLOSE UP THE FACE OF THE COURT CLERK\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156780000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:54][dialogue] CLERK: The alternate jurors are excused.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156840000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:55][narration] NARRATION: MEDIUM SHOT - THE JURY\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156900000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:56][narration] NARRATION: AU of their heads turn to camera right. Self-consciously the two alternates rise and move awkwardly out of the jury box.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704156960000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:57][narration] NARRATION: When they are gone, we hear the clerk.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157020000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:58][dialogue] CLERK: The Jury will retire.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157080000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:59][narration] NARRATION: The members of the Jury look hesitantly at each other, each reluctant to be the first to stand. Finally #3 stands up.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"timestamp\":1704157140000,\"content\":\"[angry][session_1][D1:60][narration] NARRATION: Then the others begin to rise and file slowly off left until the Jury box is empty.\"}],\"session_id\":\"s_553e926e7fa6a6296b5be996eb0a0d76c0490b5d71c0c01e1331de589f556fe6\",\"user_id\":\"u_40683a81aadb2e617cbde99e9ad516d4732d1f83d34372efaae3037f692bf2f1\"}"}
{"ts": "2026-10-30T09:44:08.299+00:00", "method": "POST", "path": "/set", "status": 200, "duration_ms": 2708.09, "body_chars": 611, "request_id": "r_0f8e1d096140432320133f1146d668c3503d34a674727069f5a9e77754b01b5f", "user_id": "u_283d6390575576a781abfde28b4c824eb707914dcb8d0b27e1cc50751af8a212", "session_id": "s_c28091240af536e731e447ec7c61d2a13dbaa70245142e14ee7a73958f820633", "body": "{\"request_id\":\"r_0f8e1d096140432320133f1146d668c3503d34a674727069f5a9e77754b01b5f\",\"user_id\":\"u_283d6390575576a781abfde28b4c824eb707914dcb8d0b27e1cc50751af8a212\",\"session_id\":\"s_c28091240af536e731e447ec7c61d2a13dbaa70245142e14ee7a73958f820633\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Streaming online QA feedback:\\n{\\\"method\\\": \\\"locomo_llm_judge\\\", \\\"predicted_answer\\\": \\\"Audrey adopted her dogs three years ago, in 2020.\\\", \\\"qa_id\\\": \\\"locomo5:q0000:step01\\\", \\\"question\\\": \\\"Which year did Audrey adopt the first three of her dogs?\\\", \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"streaming-online-feedback-v1\\\", \\\"score\\\": 1.0}\"}]}"}
